        {
          "text": "bill",
          "phraseIds": [
            "break-this-thousand-dollar-bill"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "bill"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for me?"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "櫃檯店員不好意思，可以請您幫我把這張一千元大鈔找開換零錢嗎？",
